#: ../../docs/faq/index.rst:5 0c22cf1d607f414a894d14b1613223cd
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "Frequently Asked Questions"

#: ../../docs/faq/index.rst:8 537b0ff96cf0446e8a382e13e13d84fc
msgid ""
"This chapter lists frequently asked questions and solutions during the use "
"process."
msgstr ""
"This chapter lists frequently asked questions and solutions during the use "
"process."

#: ../../docs/faq/index.rst:13 cefd4dbfe2c341e0aed6199db97786e5
msgid ""
"Due to the length of the manual, only the most important content for most "
"users is listed. If you have other needs, please contact the data center "
"technicians. Important tips:"
msgstr ""
"Due to the length of the manual, only the most important content for most "
"users is listed. If you have other needs, please contact the data center "
"technicians. Important tips:"

#: ../../docs/faq/index.rst:16 9930fd5a0fdf46ea8e561986c35a7802
msgid ""
"Please do not run executable programs directly on the login node (it greatly"
" affects the login and use efficiency of other users)."
msgstr ""
"Please do not run executable programs directly on the login node (it greatly"
" affects the login and use efficiency of other users)."

#: ../../docs/faq/index.rst:17 69353fe053b94f058feffcb88d601008
msgid ""
"If there is no special need, please submit tasks using batch processing "
"(sbatch). If you have any questions, please contact the data center "
"technicians."
msgstr ""
"If there is no special need, please submit tasks using batch processing "
"(sbatch). If you have any questions, please contact the data center "
"technicians."

#: ../../docs/faq/index.rst:18 1701b3e6c7cd44959da9f028d758aa79
msgid ""
"Please save the log file of the running program to facilitate the problem-"
"solving assistance of the data center technicians when the job is out of "
"order."
msgstr ""
"Please save the log file of the running program to facilitate the problem-"
"solving assistance of the data center technicians when the job is out of "
"order."

#: ../../docs/faq/index.rst:19 fc719d7643b54afd8bdc843078fb35e3
msgid ""
"If you need to run and debug programs on the calculation node, you can first"
" allocate a dedicated calculation node, then ssh to the calculation node."
msgstr ""
"If you need to run and debug programs on the calculation node, you can first"
" allocate a dedicated calculation node, then ssh to the calculation node."

